$ python tidy_names.py downloads
  'Holiday Photo.JPG'          -> 'holiday-photo.jpg'
  'My Notes.TXT'               -> 'my-notes.txt'
  'Scan 1.PDF'                 -> 'scan-1.pdf'
  'budget 2026.xlsx'           -> 'budget-2026.xlsx'
  'holiday photo (1).jpg'      -> 'holiday-photo-1.jpg'
  'scan 2.pdf'                 -> 'scan-2.pdf'
6 files would be renamed. Add --apply to do it.
$ python tidy_names.py downloads --apply
  'Holiday Photo.JPG'          -> 'holiday-photo.jpg'
  'My Notes.TXT'               -> 'my-notes.txt'
  'Scan 1.PDF'                 -> 'scan-1.pdf'
  'budget 2026.xlsx'           -> 'budget-2026.xlsx'
  'holiday photo (1).jpg'      -> 'holiday-photo-1.jpg'
  'scan 2.pdf'                 -> 'scan-2.pdf'
Renamed 6 files.
Now in downloads:
   Old Photos
   budget-2026.xlsx
   holiday-photo-1.jpg
   holiday-photo.jpg
   my-notes.txt
   scan-1.pdf
   scan-2.pdf
